タの雰囲気を踏襲しても良いですし、完全にオリジナルで誂えて頂いても構いません）\nNG事項：女性的な体型や、女性風の衣装\n\n●自己紹介動画\nhttps://youtu.be/_uHRjoWkDyk?si=_viqLmfdFvo-K0ru\n●Live2d、3D参考動画\nhttps://youtu.be/q73fYCWEFbk?si=0iNSZNQnQAPpQFQi\n\n以上、どうぞよろしくお願いいたしします。\n\nhttps://x.com/nishino_kizuna", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Me/works/5", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 3821523, "client_id": 576401, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/9214af65/uploads/origins/a94e3210-75f6-4d1e-b74a-293b4b663612?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2c221b3b07e2cc097bb3abf7ad53d5df", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9214af65/uploads/origins/a94e3210-75f6-4d1e-b74a-293b4b663612?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2c221b3b07e2cc097bb3abf7ad53d5df, https://si.imgix.net/9214af65/uploads/origins/a94e3210-75f6-4d1e-b74a-293b4b663612?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9b9601c40682b12c762ab64fb736d006 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9214af65/uploads/origins/a94e3210-75f6-4d1e-b74a-293b4b663612?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=90553fded9cd791ce537afe881c47d2a 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/9214af65/uploads/origins/a94e3210-75f6-4d1e-b74a-293b4b663612?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=44b16a7a31a9e383dc7b95914bf041c4", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9214af65/uploads/origins/a94e3210-75f6-4d1e-b74a-293b4b663612?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=44b16a7a31a9e383dc7b95914bf041c4, https://si.imgix.net/9214af65/uploads/origins/a94e3210-75f6-4d1e-b74a-293b4b663612?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&b